OL,3,GNEWSAAlleged drunk driver arrested
OL,4,Awhile eating Chinese
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn alleged drunk driver has been
OL,7,Farrested after police found him eating
OL,8,Fa Chinese takeaway whilst driving,
OL,9,Fmoments after he reportedly crashed
OL,10,Finto a Lamborghini.
OL,12,FThames Valley Police said the driver
OL,13,Fhad allegedly crashed into the Italian
OL,14,Fsports car on Queen Street in Bicester
OL,15,Fon Saturday.
OL,17,FThe force said the pair began to
OL,18,Fexchange details before the Lamborghini
OL,19,Fdriver noticed the man was under the
OL,20,Finfluence of alcohol, after which they
OL,21,Fcalled police.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
