OL,3,GNEWSAAlleged drunk driver arrested
OL,4,Awhile eating Chinese
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers soon located the man driving
OL,7,Fnearby in the "middle of the road", at
OL,8,Fwhich point he was stopped and arrested
OL,9,Fon suspicion of drink driving.
